$date
   Written by hand for the logic-analyser tests, November 2026
$end
$version hand-written $end
$comment
   Exercises scopes, shared and multi-character identifiers, a vector,
   x and z, a real variable and a comment between value changes.
$end
$timescale 10 ns $end
$scope module top $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 1 ! clk_copy $end
$var wire 1 %a en $end
$var wire 4 # nibble [3:0] $end
$var real 64 r temp $end
$scope module sub $end
$var wire 1 %b en $end
$upscope $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
$dumpvars
0!
x%a
b0000 #
r21.5 r
1%b
$end
